[I] Network setup scripts for vpnc / OpenConnect VPN clients

[T] vpnc-scripts provides the vpnc-script connect/disconnect helper scripts
[T] used by vpnc and OpenConnect (and similar VPN clients) to configure
[T] routing, DNS and other network settings once a VPN tunnel is established.

[U] https://gitlab.com/openconnect/vpnc-scripts

[A] OpenConnect Project
